The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository. It does not cover
the third-party experimental data packaged under analysis/ground_truth/, which
carries its own terms and attribution requirements:

- analysis/ground_truth/data/GFP_AEQVI_Sarkisyan_2016.csv is the Sarkisyan et
  al. 2016 avGFP fluorescence landscape, CC BY 4.0, redistributed with
  attribution. See analysis/ground_truth/data/SOURCES.md.
- analysis/ground_truth/structures/1EMA.cif and 1GFL.cif are wwPDB coordinate
  files, CC0 1.0 public domain.
- analysis/ground_truth/structures/P42212.fasta is from UniProt, CC BY 4.0.
